      "writtenOn": "2023-09-15T01:54:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some information: `get_mux_mode_to_set` is only called within `set_usb_mux_with_current_data_role`, and it seems like both functions came about to help share common code between TCPMv1 \u0026 TCPMv2: https://crrev.com/c/1990425\n\nA concern: `mux_set` and `set_usb_mux_with_current_data_role` do the same thing but in slightly different ways: for `mux_set` the caller determines the next state of the mux, but in `set_usb_mux_with_current_data_role`, the next state is inferred by the function internally. We can\u0027t do a simple replacement of one for the other.",
      "parentUuid": "7f0e20fc_79c2e427",
      "revId": "fee06cf333fa2c34fb8fd7f0cebd46e866161fed",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
